+| --- | --- |
.superpowers/sdd/release-task-5b-report.md:27: trailing whitespace.
+| `publication_instructions_viewed` | Publication details become available; deduplicated once per mounted work item. |
.superpowers/sdd/release-task-5b-report.md:28: trailing whitespace.
