.superpowers/sdd/release-task-5b-report.md:29: trailing whitespace.
+| `publication_proof_submitted` | Initial proof mutation resolves with canonical attempt number 1. |
.superpowers/sdd/release-task-5b-report.md:30: trailing whitespace.
