+- No account ownership verification in v1.
docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-17-adfocate-trust-profile-bundle.md:15: trailing whitespace.
+- No public display of unverified handles, follower counts, engagement rates, or recent post data.
docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-17-adfocate-trust-profile-bundle.md:16: trailing whitespace.
+- No password, OAuth, or social account login flow.
docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-17-adfocate-trust-profile-bundle.md:17: trailing whitespace.
+- No audience demographic inference in v1.
docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-17-adfocate-trust-profile-bundle.md:18: trailing whitespace.
+- No large raw post archive. Store only bounded summaries needed for profile insight and trend history.
docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-17-adfocate-trust-profile-bundle.md:19: trailing whitespace.
+- `RAPIDAPI_KEY` stays backend-only.
docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-17-adfocate-trust-profile-bundle.md:20: trailing whitespace.
+- Production scan actions are disabled when `RAPIDAPI_KEY` is missing.
docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-17-adfocate-trust-profile-bundle.md:21: trailing whitespace.
+- A synced count is labeled `API-synced`.
docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-17-adfocate-trust-profile-bundle.md:22: trailing whitespace.
+- Any synced account without ownership proof is also labeled `Ownership not verified`.
docs/superpowers/plans/2026-06-17-adfocate-trust-profile-bundle.md:23: trailing whitespace.
+- Public passport can show derived trust badges only, such as `Social scan connected`, `Active creator`, or `Fresh profile activity`.
