+## 1. Purpose
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:9: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:10: trailing whitespace.
+Adfocate already contains the mechanics needed for a credible creator platform: passwordless authentication, resumable onboarding, social-profile connection and verification, mission matching, points and cash earnings, creator levels, notifications, and bilingual UI. The creator experience does not yet combine those mechanics into one clear activation journey.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:11: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:12: trailing whitespace.
+This slice creates an activation spine across acquisition, sign-in, onboarding, profile readiness, the creator dashboard, mission discovery, and the first mission view. It reuses the current React, TanStack Router, TanStack Query, Hono, Supabase, and i18n architecture. It does not rewrite the application or change payment, eligibility, XP, or mission-state business rules.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:13: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:14: trailing whitespace.
+The product loop introduced by this slice is:
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:15: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:16: trailing whitespace.
+> Understand value -> Sign in -> Build a useful profile -> See suitable work -> Know the next action -> Open the first suitable mission
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:17: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:18: trailing whitespace.
+## 2. Current-State Assessment
