+
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:20: trailing whitespace.
+### Strengths
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:21: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:22: trailing whitespace.
+- The public creator proposition already communicates growth, missions, Creator Passport, earnings, and levels.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:23: trailing whitespace.
+- Authentication is passwordless and first authentication bootstraps a creator account.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:24: trailing whitespace.
+- Onboarding persists its step and already supports interests, social handles, recommendations, and a completion reward.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:25: trailing whitespace.
+- The application has real mission, wallet, profile, verification, notification, level, and earnings surfaces.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:26: trailing whitespace.
+- The app uses one bilingual dictionary and responsive app shells with bottom navigation on mobile and side navigation on larger screens.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:27: trailing whitespace.
+- A recent UX pass improved focus handling, bottom-navigation wrapping, heading hierarchy, mobile overlap, and several empty and error states.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:28: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:29: trailing whitespace.
+### Primary Friction
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:30: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:31: trailing whitespace.
+- The public promise is richer than the post-login activation experience.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:32: trailing whitespace.
+- Login errors expose provider language such as rate limits without a recovery action or retry timing.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:33: trailing whitespace.
+- Onboarding is resumable but does not offer consistent back navigation, explicit autosave feedback, or a final readiness summary.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:34: trailing whitespace.
+- Optional social entry and later verification are not framed clearly enough as separate stages.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:35: trailing whitespace.
+- Dashboard content is a collection of useful cards rather than a prioritized daily command centre.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:36: trailing whitespace.
+- Profile completion has no shared, transparent definition.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:37: trailing whitespace.
+- Mission cards omit several decision-critical facts and do not explain why a mission matches the creator.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:38: trailing whitespace.
+- Mission detail goes directly from facts and brief to Apply or Join without a compact commitment summary.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:39: trailing whitespace.
+- Empty states do not consistently route creators toward the next useful action.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:40: trailing whitespace.
+- Activation and funnel analytics do not have one typed event contract.
