+### Goals
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:49: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:50: trailing whitespace.
+1. Make the value and earning model clear before and during sign-in.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:51: trailing whitespace.
+2. Make onboarding resumable, forgiving, and explicit about required versus optional information.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:52: trailing whitespace.
+3. Give every creator a transparent readiness model based on meaningful progress.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:53: trailing whitespace.
+4. Put one deterministic next-best action at the top of the dashboard.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:54: trailing whitespace.
+5. Help creators decide whether a mission is suitable without decoding a long brief.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:55: trailing whitespace.
+6. Create useful no-mission and partial-failure states without fake demand or urgency.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-13-adfocate-creator-activation-spine-design.md:56: trailing whitespace.
+7. Instrument the activation funnel without collecting unnecessary personal data.
