+## 4. Design principles
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-15-adfocate-active-mission-workspace-design.md:62: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-15-adfocate-active-mission-workspace-design.md:63: trailing whitespace.
+1. **One next action.** Every creator-visible state identifies the responsible party, deadline, blocking reason, and next action.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-15-adfocate-active-mission-workspace-design.md:64: trailing whitespace.
+2. **Source-backed facts.** The UI derives state from authoritative workflow records and never infers approval or reward from presentation state.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-15-adfocate-active-mission-workspace-design.md:65: trailing whitespace.
+3. **Per-deliverable truth.** A mission may contain multiple deliverables with independent drafts, feedback, deadlines, and approval.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-15-adfocate-active-mission-workspace-design.md:66: trailing whitespace.
+4. **Immutable decisions.** Submitted versions and completed review decisions cannot be edited in place.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-15-adfocate-active-mission-workspace-design.md:67: trailing whitespace.
+5. **Explicit reward boundary.** Approved to publish is not completed, rewarded, paid, or published.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-15-adfocate-active-mission-workspace-design.md:68: trailing whitespace.
+6. **Recoverable work.** Upload, autosave, query, and review failures preserve useful context and provide a specific recovery action.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-15-adfocate-active-mission-workspace-design.md:69: trailing whitespace.
+7. **Workspace isolation.** Creator and operator access remains tenant scoped and least privileged.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-15-adfocate-active-mission-workspace-design.md:70: trailing whitespace.
+8. **Gradual rollout.** Legacy missions continue to work until a mission explicitly enables the active workspace.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-15-adfocate-active-mission-workspace-design.md:71: trailing whitespace.
+9. **Privacy-limited measurement.** Analytics excludes creator-authored content and direct identifiers.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-15-adfocate-active-mission-workspace-design.md:72: trailing whitespace.
+
