docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-22-adfocate-publication-proof-validation-design.md:287: trailing whitespace.
+- use HTTPS;
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-22-adfocate-publication-proof-validation-design.md:288: trailing whitespace.
+- contain no embedded credentials;
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-22-adfocate-publication-proof-validation-design.md:289: trailing whitespace.
