docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-22-adfocate-publication-proof-validation-design.md:291: trailing whitespace.
+- reject non-standard ports unless explicitly allowed by policy;
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-22-adfocate-publication-proof-validation-design.md:292: trailing whitespace.
