+
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-31-adfocate-mission-completion-reward-handoff-design.md:21: trailing whitespace.
+1. The next phase is mission completion plus `reward_pending`, not reward issuance or payout.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-31-adfocate-mission-completion-reward-handoff-design.md:22: trailing whitespace.
+2. Completion uses a system eligibility gate followed by explicit operator approval.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-31-adfocate-mission-completion-reward-handoff-design.md:23: trailing whitespace.
+3. Reward amounts come from an immutable contract frozen when the creator joins.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-31-adfocate-mission-completion-reward-handoff-design.md:24: trailing whitespace.
+4. `reward_pending` is a durable finance handoff and does not mutate any financial balance or budget.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-31-adfocate-mission-completion-reward-handoff-design.md:25: trailing whitespace.
+5. Legacy `mission_submissions.status` remains unchanged.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-31-adfocate-mission-completion-reward-handoff-design.md:26: trailing whitespace.
+6. Erroneous pending decisions use append-only cancellation with a required reason and return the workflow to `proof_verified`.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-31-adfocate-mission-completion-reward-handoff-design.md:27: trailing whitespace.
+7. The creator sees a workspace-configured processing SLA snapshot and a target timestamp when one can be calculated.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-31-adfocate-mission-completion-reward-handoff-design.md:28: trailing whitespace.
+8. The creator receives in-app notifications for both pending and cancellation decisions.
docs/superpowers/specs/2026-07-31-adfocate-mission-completion-reward-handoff-design.md:29: trailing whitespace.
