+### 5.2 Mission Matching Agent
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:457: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:458: trailing whitespace.
+**Purpose:** Auto-pair creators to new missions and generate invite notifications.
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:459: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:460: trailing whitespace.
+**Workflow:**
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:461: trailing whitespace.
+1. Brand posts mission → `mission.created` event fires to BullMQ queue
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:462: trailing whitespace.
+2. Agent queries eligible creators filtered by `required_level` + `category`
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:463: trailing whitespace.
+3. Scores each creator (0–100 fit_score):
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:464: trailing whitespace.
+   - Category overlap: 40%
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:465: trailing whitespace.
+   - Past performance in same brand category: 30%
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:466: trailing whitespace.
+   - Brand Safety score: 20%
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:467: trailing whitespace.
+   - Reliability score: 10%
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:468: trailing whitespace.
+4. Writes ranked matches to `mission_matches` table
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:469: trailing whitespace.
+5. Pushes invites to top-N creators via email + LINE/WhatsApp
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:470: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:471: trailing whitespace.
+**Model:** GPT-4o mini (cost-optimised structured output)  
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:472: trailing whitespace.
