+### 5.3 Content Review Agent
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:475: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:476: trailing whitespace.
+**Purpose:** First-pass automated moderation before human review.
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:477: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:478: trailing whitespace.
+**Workflow:**
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:479: trailing whitespace.
+1. Creator submits content URLs → `submission.created` event
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:480: trailing whitespace.
+2. Agent fetches content metadata (public URL or platform API)
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:481: trailing whitespace.
+3. Evaluates against mission brief via structured checklist:
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:482: trailing whitespace.
+   - Brand mention present
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:483: trailing whitespace.
+   - Required hashtags included
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:484: trailing whitespace.
+   - Product visibility (image/video frames)
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:485: trailing whitespace.
+   - No competitor mentions
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:486: trailing whitespace.
+   - Disclosure language (#ad / #sponsored / 已提供產品)
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:487: trailing whitespace.
+   - No prohibited content (brand safety)
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:488: trailing whitespace.
+4. Output: `{pass: boolean, flags: string[], confidence: number}`
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:489: trailing whitespace.
+5. If `pass && confidence > 0.85` → **auto-approve** + award points/XP
