+### 10.3 CPM Mission Billing Flow
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:775: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:776: trailing whitespace.
+1. Brand sets CPM rate (e.g. HK$40/1K views) + max budget pool (e.g. HK$3,000)
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:777: trailing whitespace.
+2. Budget escrowed upfront at mission creation
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:778: trailing whitespace.
+3. Creator submits Reel URL → system polls view count via Instagram API every 24h for 30 days
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:779: trailing whitespace.
+4. At day 30: `payout = (total_views / 1000) × cpm_rate`
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:780: trailing whitespace.
+5. Creator receives cash to earnings wallet (minus 15% platform fee)
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:781: trailing whitespace.
+6. Unused escrow returned to brand within 3 business days
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:782: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:783: trailing whitespace.
