+### What KoLink Does Well
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:1063: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:1064: trailing whitespace.
+KoLink is a CPM-first HK creator platform with radical simplicity: brands deposit budget, set a CPM rate, creators film Reels, views are auto-tracked for 30 days, income auto-settles. Zero manual invoicing. Zero follower requirement.
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:1065: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:1066: trailing whitespace.
