+## 16. Key Technical Decisions
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:1096: trailing whitespace.
+
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:1097: trailing whitespace.
+| Decision | Chosen | Alternative | Rationale |
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:1098: trailing whitespace.
+|---|---|---|---|
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:1099: trailing whitespace.
+| Backend language | TypeScript / Hono | Keep Laravel | Shared types with frontend; better AI library ecosystem; team skill fit |
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:1100: trailing whitespace.
+| ORM | Prisma | TypeORM / Drizzle | Best DX; auto-migration; schema-first type generation |
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:1101: trailing whitespace.
+| Multi-tenancy | Schema-per-tenant | Row-level (RLS) | Full isolation; no cross-tenant data leak risk |
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:1102: trailing whitespace.
+| AI orchestration | Direct service calls | LangChain / LlamaIndex | Less abstraction overhead; full prompt control |
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:1103: trailing whitespace.
+| Queue | BullMQ (Redis) | SQS / RabbitMQ | Simple setup; Redis already needed for cache |
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:1104: trailing whitespace.
+| Frontend deployment | Cloudflare Pages (SPA) | SSR on Zeabur | Better CDN; no cold start; existing CF ecosystem |
docs/superpowers/specs/adfocate-2-spec.md:1105: trailing whitespace.
